# Windows MSI packaging via WiX.
#
# Created in M4 (Distribution & UI milestone).
# Tauri's bundle.targets=["msi"] generates the MSI; this folder holds:
#   - WiX fragment files for non-default behavior
#   - Postinstall scripts (registry entries, PATH addition)
#   - License file (LICENSE.rtf for the EULA dialog)
#   - Banner/dialog images (optional branded UI)
#
# See docs/architecture/0008-distribution-strategy.md
